#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "InfomaterialCutGraphLaw")
  ("version" 3)
  ("precondition" "The customer supplies one placement-neutral M1 circuit family, its exact sovereign occurrence assembly, one recursive material-cover receipt, and exact observed carrier demands for every mount. The provider contracts the independently hireable refinement-gated infomaterial layout provider through its valid signed A2A Agent Card and same-origin JWKS, and its own witness-journal RDF memory provider.")
  ("operation" "Obtain an independent exact layout assay; derive the reusable component containment dependency graph; count contextual occurrences without duplicating reusable definitions; bind each definition only to admitted material roots, proof profiles, refinement providers, and refinement receipt identities; and compute maximal deterministic leaf-first parallel waves with the root board as the unique final wave.")
